            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, emotion, fear, mental)\n\nThe megaprimatus beats its chest in a terrifying display. Creatures within 50 feet must attempt a DC 27 Will save. While a creature is frightened by this ability, it is flat-footed to the megaprimatus and to gorillas.\n\nCritical Success: No effect and temporarily immune for 1 minute.\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected.\nFailure: The creature is frightened 1.\nCritical Failure: The creature is frightened 2 and fleeing until the end of its next turn."
